## Requirements

- **C++{{ cpp_standard | regex_replace(pat="C\\+\\+", repl="") }}** compatible compiler
  - GCC 7+ (for C++17), GCC 10+ (for C++20)
  - Clang 5+ (for C++17), Clang 12+ (for C++20)
  - MSVC 2017+ (for C++17), MSVC 2022 (for C++20)
- **CMake 3.15+** (for building tests/examples)
{% if include_tests %}
- **Catch2** (automatically downloaded for testing)
{% endif %}

